Subject: [PATCH] Reclaim request-owned Emscripten I/O and timer state

Includes a managed SDK patch and exact-prefix cache migration. No arbitrary SDK
override or Rust unsafe code. See docs/runtime-memory.md for the actual reproducer.

diff --git a/worker-build/src/emscripten.rs b/worker-build/src/emscripten.rs
--- a/worker-build/src/emscripten.rs
+++ b/worker-build/src/emscripten.rs
@@ -23,6 +23,10 @@
     (
