+Subject: [PATCH] Reclaim anonymous I/O nodes and request-owned event callbacks
+
+Base: Emscripten 6.0.10 after the pinned epoll and DNS patches.
+Actual workerd repeated-request heap reproducer: repro/https and
+scripts/observe-local-memory.mjs. Map entries are deleted on completion/cancel;
+IDs remain signed i32 and skip live IDs on wrap. No thread or runtime changes.
+
